# package-lock.json is resolved Linux-complete (node:22-alpine — the CI/Docker/deploy
# target). It includes every platform's optional native deps (@tailwindcss/oxide-*,
# @img/sharp-*) plus the Linux wasm-runtime transitive deps (@emnapi/*, wasi-threads)
# that a Linux `npm ci` requires. Regenerate it on Linux after dependency changes
# (e.g. `npm install --package-lock-only` inside node:22-alpine) so Docker/CI stay
# green. A Windows `npm install` may locally re-drop the Linux-only optional entries —
# do NOT commit that; keep the Linux-complete lockfile as the committed baseline.
